From e531f00929748684409d5036486adc6d60cf2c9c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:50:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: type wallet transaction, script-manager and import
 events

Migrate 22 remaining transaction/manager/import callers together. Retain
Info, exact wallet prefixes/text, raw transaction/block/manager IDs,
output indices and native Amount integer units. Keep readable static
new/update/grouping fragments alongside raw boolean state. Capture only
already-displayed public keys, scripts, addresses and public descriptor
ToString; private material and ToPrivateString are not introduced.
All wallet, relay, conflict, fee-selection and import behavior is unchanged.
Shared eCash wallet tier, before V2 wallet adaptations.

Mechanical commands used (ast-grep-py==0.51.0):
  /private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python /private/tmp/apply-wallet-transaction-callers.py
  git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/wallet/scriptpubkeyman.cpp src/wallet/wallet.cpp src/wallet/spend.cpp src/wallet/receive.cpp src/wallet/rpc/backup.cpp
  /private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/wallet_callers.py --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/wallet-keypool-callers.json --report /private/tmp/wallet-transaction-source-idempotent.json

The existing single cumulative wallet catalog retains every reviewed old
caller/new expression; replay the complete catalog from the PWA group
boundary to reproduce the wallet source transformations as a batch.
No new per-group tools, catalogs or tests are added here. Scoped source
checks pass: reviewed diff, existing exact-message/severity validator,
idempotent replay, typed-event lint (55 sites in these files), diff check.
SOURCE ONLY: NOT_COMPILED/NOT_RUN; no native/runtime/performance claim.
